t":"無意識に不用意な言葉を発することが多く、それが他者の触れられたくない本質だったりするため、やっかまれることも多い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27170","sourceWorkId":"3209","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウェイトレス。本業は大学生で、南条と同じゼミに所属している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔南条に助けられたことがあり、そのことが縁で南条のことが気になっている。しかしそれは好意というより知的好奇心に近い感情。世界から浮き上がっているように見える南条のことが妙に気になっている。次第に大学に姿を見せなくなった南条を心配し、大学に戻るよう説得するため同じ職場で働くようになった。そのことを周囲の人間は知らない。不用意に余計なこと（しかも本質的なこと）を言って、南条を苛立たせることが多い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"147463"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"98 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27170","sourceWorkId":"3209","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27170","sourceWorkId":"3209","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27170","sourceWorkId":"3209","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"96 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27170","sourceWorkId":"3209","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27170","sourceWorkId":"3209","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de9dd58e367d5a858b378d963ee5501b641bc0eddfc4298dd674581ea106bc90.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/850eb6c2cfe3f80ad5a7062af9bdaff2ad83a6d2022fd15a686a200a760f594b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐々木あかり","creatorId":"vndb:s1575","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1575","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1575","name":"佐々木あかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:296397:147463:19495:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"cha